the opportunity to hire local talent.

00:03:53.033 --> 00:03:58.189
We also worked with Palestinian software
engineers straight out of college

00:03:58.189 --> 00:04:03.262
creating a training program for them to
hone in on those hard skills and gain

00:04:03.262 --> 00:04:08.517
that a little bit of experience before
landing that first job out of college.

00:04:08.517 --> 00:04:12.392
Now Tech Brigde is just one of many
incredible organizations working to

00:04:12.392 --> 00:04:15.752
enhance cross border collaborations
between the Israeli and

00:04:15.752 --> 00:04:17.506
Palestinian tech ecosystems.

00:04:17.506 --> 00:04:23.614
And today, we have nearly 1000 Palestinian
software engineers working for

00:04:23.614 --> 00:04:28.394
Israeli Startups, and
Israeli branches of multinationals.

00:04:28.394 --> 00:04:33.602
So, Mellanox for example, an Israeli
company that was recently sold for

00:04:33.602 --> 00:04:38.642
$7 billion, employs over 150
Palestinian software engineers,

00:04:38.642 --> 00:04:41.668
30 of them working remotely out of Gaza.

00:04:41.668 --> 00:04:45.648
Kratos and Israeli Startup in
the freight industry actually

00:04:45.648 --> 00:04:49.716
established an R&amp;D center in Ramadan,
