00:07:11.145 --> 00:07:16.541
And suddenly you have Israelis and
Palestinians working shoulder to shoulder,

00:07:16.541 --> 00:07:21.459
it's an incredible opportunity for
us to get to know each other to replace

00:07:21.459 --> 00:07:26.141
Alien Nation with familiarity and
to replace that faceless enemy with

00:07:26.141 --> 00:07:32.880
